OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785680281
OL,3,CTwo vehicles 'completely burnt out'
OL,4,Cafter arson attack in Portadown
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for information
OL,7,Ffollowing an arson attack in Portadown
OL,8,Fon Saturday.
OL,10,FLocal policing Sergeant Bigger said:
OL,11,F"It was reported that the fire had
OL,12,Fstarted at around 10.20pm, at a
OL,13,Fvehicle yard.
OL,15,F"Officers attended alongside
OL,16,Fcolleagues from Northern Ireland Fire
OL,17,F& Rescue Service, who extinguished the
OL,18,Fblaze. Two recovery vehicles were
OL,19,Fcompletely burnt out.
OL,26,@sD@AOU
