OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1785680281
OL,3,CTwo vehicles 'completely burnt out'
OL,4,Cafter arson attack in Portadown
OL,6,F"It's been confirmed that this fire
OL,7,Fwas started deliberately by two man
OL,8,Fwearing dark clothing and face
OL,9,Fcoverings.
OL,11,F"As our investigation continues, we
OL,12,Fwould appeal to anyone who may have
OL,13,Fnoticed any suspicious activity in the
OL,14,Farea to call police on 101, quoting
OL,15,Freference 1688 01/08/26.
OL,17,F"We're particularly keen to hear from
OL,18,Fanyone who may have relevant dashcam,
OL,19,FCCTV or doorbell footage."
OL,26,@yD@AOU
